7, "id": "34", "resolution": "480x360"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/fznmawhm2hI/hqdefault.webp", "preference": -6, "id": "35"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fznmawhm2hI/sddefault.jpg", "height": 480, "width": 640, "preference": -5, "id": "36", "resolution": "640x480"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/fznmawhm2hI/sddefault.webp", "preference": -4, "id": "37"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fznmawhm2hI/hq720.jpg", "preference": -3, "id": "38"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/fznmawhm2hI/hq720.webp", "preference": -2, "id": "39"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fznmawhm2hI/maxresdefault.jpg", "height": 1080, "width": 1920, "preference": -1, "id": "40", "resolution": "1920x1080"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/fznmawhm2hI/maxresdefault.webp", "preference": 0, "id": "41"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fznmawhm2hI/maxresdefault.jpg", "description": "This Gen AI showreel demonstrates how we create cinematic films using controlled AI, CGI, VFX, and high-performance GPU systems.\n\nThese visuals were not shot in real life.\nBut they are not random prompt outputs either.\n\nUnlike basic prompt-based AI platforms, our process combines structured prompt engineering, cinematic direction, CGI refinement, and GPU-powered rendering to maintain full creative control over every frame.\n\nWe build hyper-real AI human models featuring:\n* Lifelike skin textures\n* Accurate anatomy\n* Natural movement\n* Expressive gestures\n* Raw, believable emotions\nThese are not generic AI avatars. They are carefully directed digital performances.\n\nBeyond characters, we craft cinematic environments with professional lighting design, atmospheric depth, and VFX detailing, achieving the polish of a high-budget production without a traditional shoot.\n\nOur structured workflow eliminates the distortions and unpredictability common in prompt-only outputs:\nStep 1: Define narrative, mood boards, and lock creative identity.\nStep 2: Generate controlled AI scenes with iterative refinement and performance direction.\nStep 3: Enhance using advanced VFX, motion design, sound design, and cinematic finishing.\n\nThe result?\nAI-powered films that feel real, but remain fully controllable, scalable, and production-ready.\nBecause the future of production isn’t AI-generated. It’s AI-directed.\n\n\nvery product model, environment, animation, and character is produced using our unique proprietary CGI, VFX & AI production pipeline powered by our high-end GPU computers. Our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, ensuring premium quality and marketplace-ready output designed to drive conversions and add-to-cart.\n\nWe create e-commerce listing videos that follow proven marketplace guidelines, showing the product within the first 3 seconds, delivering a strong visual hook, clear benefits, and real-life usage across multiple settings. Clean, platform-optimized visuals are designed for Amazon, Flipkart, Shopify, and D2C websites to drive higher add-to-cart and conversions. Shopify reports up to 28 percent higher sales for products showcased clearly on video, while Meta and Amazon emphasize benefit-led visuals for stronger purchase intent.\n\n🔗 Learn more: https://www.v4b.ai\n📩 Business inquiries: grow@v4b.ai\n\nV4b.ai is an Agency creating Content & Videos Without Any Physical Shoot, using high-end GPU Computers powering CGI, VFX, and AI, operated by specialists. Our production-grade pipelines outperform prompt-based GenAI platforms, delivering cinematic Ad Films, eCommerce Videos, and more from Concept to Final Cut. \n\neCommerce/D2C Listing Videos - Most D2C buyers abandon eCom pages without completing a purchase as they aren’t convinced by images alone. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, then producing Marketplace-Optimized Videos & Images, that increase ‘Add-to-Cart’ by building customer trust, ready to get listed on Amazon, Shopify & more.\n\nFrom Concept to Final Cut, we create Ad Films - Our custom production tech-stack helps our creative team with realistic environments, lifelike AI humans, multi-language voiceovers and dialogues. No sets. No actors. Just Platform-Optimized Films ready for YouTube, Meta, TV, OTT & more.\n\n#AIAdFilm #AICommercial #AIVideoProduction #AIGeneratedVideo #GenerativeAI\n#CGICommercial #CGIAd #VFXCommercial #VFXAd\n#VirtualProduction #NoShootAd #VirtualAd\n#FutureOfAdvertising #AIInMarketing #DigitalAdvertising\n#BrandFilm #AdFilm #ProductAd #3DCommercial", "channel_id": "UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "duration": 111, "view_count": 172, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fznmawhm2hI", "categories": ["Film & Animation"], "tags": ["AI ad film", "AI commercial", "AI generated video", "AI video production", "generative AI advertising", "CGI commercial", "CGI ad film", "VFX commercial", "VFX ad film", "virtual production ad", "no shoot advertisement", "virtual ad film", "digital advertising", "future of advertising", "AI marketing video", "brand film", "product ad video", "3D commercial", "synthetic media", "creative technology", "AI content creation", "next gen advertising", "AI powered ads", "virtual filmmaking", "AI visual effects"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en-orig": [{"ext": "json3", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=fznmawhm2hI&ei=TydWap-lKaeE0u8Pn5uukAU&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&xospf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1784056255&sparams=ip